# Village encounters: little things that happen as you walk around.
# SPOILERS: the answers.
# Which encounters come up depends on the day. Day 1: the hiker in the alley (morning), the hiker at the bus
# stop (morning), 할아버지's fish (afternoon, river). Day 2: 지호's quiz (afternoon, alley). Day 3: the fish (morning).

chapter village
idle
encounters on
expect day=1&time:morning&money=20000
#@ Encounters · day 1 morning
spot Front gate
choose 오른쪽이에요
idle
expect money=21000&@golmok
spot Right path
spot Bus stop
number 13:00
idle
spot Path behind the bus stop
expect !rel:haraboji>=1
wait
choose 일곱 마리
idle
expect rel:haraboji=1&@gang&time:afternoon
map madang
wait
sleep
expect day=2&time:morning
#@ Encounters · day 2
wait
map golmok
choose 가방이에요
idle
expect rel:jiho=1
map madang
wait
sleep
# --- day 3: the fish again, and a wrong count earns nothing
map gang
choose 다섯 마리
idle
expect rel:haraboji=1
